{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"18fd0025-9c10-478d-a5b4-5be923afb8b6","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The integration issue was caused by sending the OAuth **scope** request as a comma‑separated list, which Intervals.icu does not accept. I updated the scopes to a space‑separated format and documented the fix.\n\n- Updated scopes: `SCOPES = \"ACTIVITY:READ ACTIVITY:WRITE WELLNESS:READ CALENDAR:READ CALENDAR:WRITE\"` in [config.py](file:///tmp/h-yKlPZi/config.py)  \n- Added a full explanation of the root cause and fix in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-yKlPZi/ANSWER.md)  \n\nYou can review the detailed summary there.\n","duration_seconds":30.500898,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":15986,"output_tokens":3285,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":78272,"total_tokens":19271}}}
